# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PhysioNet-restricted data must NEVER reach a commit.
# Everything derived from MIMIC-III / MIMIC-IV / MIMIC-IV-Note is credentialed
# access. Embedding caches and parquet/pickle intermediates are derived data
# and are just as restricted as the raw tables.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
results/
figures/

# Collaborator-shared satellite dataset (REAP / Hurricane Helene, exported
# from Yujuan Gao's Dropbox): ~425 MB of GeoTIFF chips and her pipeline
# outputs — large binaries, and not ours to redistribute. Already matched by
# the unanchored `data/` rule above; listed explicitly so the exclusion
# survives even if that rule is ever narrowed. Verified with
# `git check-ignore -v REAP/data/...`.
REAP/data/

# (2026-08-20) The collaborator pushed her pipeline notebooks herself to the
# repo-root `scripts/` (commit 9bbc182), which is now the canonical copy; the
# 2026-08-19 whitelist exception for REAP/data/scripts/ was removed and the
# local Dropbox copies there are untracked again (kept on disk, ignored here).

# Local absolute paths to credentialed data roots.
# config/paths.example.yaml IS committable and is deliberately not ignored.
# NOTE the leading `**/`: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to the repo
# root, so a bare `config/paths.yaml` would NOT match
# `preliminary/config/paths.yaml`. Verified with `git check-ignore`.
**/config/paths.yaml

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Embedding cache (content-addressed note text -> vectors: derived MIMIC data)
.emb_cache/

# Serialized intermediates
*.parquet
*.pkl
